    "description": "Researches implementation patterns for a generative-AI feature by comparing a relevant open-source example: architecture, provider boundaries, costs and tests before adapting any code. Use this skill when: a project needs a generative-AI feature and an existing open-source implementation may serve as reference. Do NOT use this skill when: the project has no generative-AI feature or the work is limited to one provider's API usage with no architecture decision.",
