    "description": "Reviews docs and prose for Writing Guidelines compliance, checking style, voice and tone against the writing handbook. Use this skill when: asked to review docs, check writing style, audit prose or check a page against the writing handbook. Do NOT use this skill when: cleaning invisible marks or provenance from text (use polishing-user-facing-prose or stripping-ai-provenance-marks) or writing architecture decision records (use documenting-architecture-decisions).",
