    "description": "Cleans and finalizes authorized natural-language text for readers by auditing invisible Unicode and rewriting prose while keeping facts, meaning and the writer voice. Use this skill when: asked to clean, humanize, polish or finalize an article or user-facing text the user owns. Do NOT use this skill when: removing provenance metadata from files (use stripping-ai-provenance-marks) or reviewing style against a handbook (use auditing-writing-guidelines).",
