    "description": "Configures spending limits, token quotas and rate-limit policies per API key or globally, inspects current consumption and enforces cost controls across providers. Use this skill when: capping spend, tokens or request rates for a key or the whole deployment. Do NOT use this skill when: only reading usage history (use analyzing-usage-call-logs) or managing the keys themselves (use managing-api-keys).",
