    "description": "Drives development with tests in a red-green-refactor loop when implementing logic, fixing a bug or changing behavior, to prove that the code works. Use this skill when: implementing any logic, fixing any bug or changing existing behavior. Do NOT use this skill when: the work is a browser-level check of a running page (use testing-in-browser-with-devtools) or a codebase quality scan (use scanning-codebase-quality).",
